Canonical agent rules live in `AGENTS.md` at the repo root; read it first.
Summary of the hard rules:

- Swift 6 strict concurrency with MainActor default isolation (pinned in
  `Config/Shared.xcconfig`); never lower it, fix the code instead.
- SwiftUI Model-View only: `@State`/`@Observable`/`@Environment`/`@Binding`,
  no ViewModels, `.task {}` for async tied to view lifecycle.
- Swift Testing for unit tests; XCTest only in `APPNAMEUITests`.
- Build settings → `Config/*.xcconfig`; capabilities → the entitlements file;
  don't edit the pbxproj for settings.
- Format with `Scripts/format.sh`; build/test with `Scripts/build.sh` and
  `Scripts/test.sh`.
